  "description": "A Musketeer of righteous and just heart from another world. Many are familiar with the story of his encounter with the heroes known as the Three Musketeers, and how this helped him grow as a person. The words he spoke to display his comradery with the Musketeers in the heat of battle have become the stuff of legend. He was regarded with favor by both ruffians and nobles alike, as this champion of the people is said to have always been fair, even with prisoners.",
